{"steam_appid":4090720,"steam_name":"Edge of Destruction","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4090720/865014886/f3a7d42b9bf916eada30c919d967ab511c777a9a/1776074850/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1776075301","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257303630/8c1aca177813448c8aea160905bf43a9355fe41f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1776075301","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090720/64b4594a2a52aba394c48c2d94a8f29e0ea46b63/ss_64b4594a2a52aba394c48c2d94a8f29e0ea46b63.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785379195","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090720/0f08485a635652aa03e06f8a8411a87b5b0afc05/ss_0f08485a635652aa03e06f8a8411a87b5b0afc05.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785379195","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090720/211070f47bf65ee8dcbf649ecdb4a1fc662a0043/ss_211070f47bf65ee8dcbf649ecdb4a1fc662a0043.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785379195","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090720/53a95595e9341c1559d1c2e729ff53c154ba9831/ss_53a95595e9341c1559d1c2e729ff53c154ba9831.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785379195","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090720/54e09d993849f043e912878ed2446666651c637c/ss_54e09d993849f043e912878ed2446666651c637c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785379195"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Break the World, Break the Guilt.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Sara</strong>. After a mysterious car crash, you wake up trapped in a haunting, surreal world—a reality you subconsciously built to escape a tragic mistake. This is not a sanctuary; it is a cage of your own making. Instead of facing the truth, you choose a different path: <strong>destruction</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>EDGE OF DESTRUCTION </strong></i>is a single-player FPS built around a single, powerful mechanic: <strong>Total Environmental Destruction</strong>. Tear down the walls of your denial, shatter the world piece by piece, and confront the haunting echoes of what you've done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't just another shooter. It's an emotionally charged, atmospheric journey crafted for players who demand <strong>intensity, meaning, and total chaos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090720/extras/02be665841f5ff7bdeb0a544a79f773f.poster.avif?t=1785379195\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090720/extras/02be665841f5ff7bdeb0a544a79f773f.webm?t=1785379195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090720/extras/02be665841f5ff7bdeb0a544a79f773f.mp4?t=1785379195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧱 <strong>Total Environment Destruction:</strong> Every structure, wall, and object is fully destructible. Use chaos tactically in combat, but be warned: flying debris and falling structures are a threat to you and your enemies alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090720/extras/e1aac7dedf81a715a9a04254ca9e8faa.poster.avif?t=1785379195\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090720/extras/e1aac7dedf81a715a9a04254ca9e8faa.webm?t=1785379195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090720/extras/e1aac7dedf81a715a9a04254ca9e8faa.mp4?t=1785379195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎬 <strong>Cinematic, Sci-Fi Thriller:</strong> Immerse yourself in a gripping narrative. A bold blend of rich atmosphere, emotional stakes, and surreal sci-fi elements that challenge the boundaries of reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090720/extras/54e9f2f9aa243d272fc0261a833e02aa.poster.avif?t=1785379195\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090720/extras/54e9f2f9aa243d272fc0261a833e02aa.webm?t=1785379195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090720/extras/54e9f2f9aa243d272fc0261a833e02aa.mp4?t=1785379195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ <strong>Handcrafted Boss Encounters:</strong> Engage in dynamic, unforgettable boss battles that actively change and evolve the environment as you fight. Expect no filler, just pure, intense, handcrafted moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090720/extras/47f162dc63538309760b564925e2d99b.poster.avif?t=1785379195\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090720/extras/47f162dc63538309760b564925e2d99b.webm?t=1785379195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090720/extras/47f162dc63538309760b564925e2d99b.mp4?t=1785379195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>A Love Letter to Single-Player FPS:</strong> Experience tight, focused design with meaningful content. Forget bloated open worlds; this is pure player immersion and a complete, self-contained story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090720/extras/b60226e04b9d72d2f0cbd8c6b8b6308c.poster.avif?t=1785379195\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090720/extras/b60226e04b9d72d2f0cbd8c6b8b6308c.webm?t=1785379195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090720/extras/b60226e04b9d72d2f0cbd8c6b8b6308c.mp4?t=1785379195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ <strong>Visually Stunning &amp; Optimized:</strong> Experience a graphically superb world designed to feel real and engaging. We are committed to a <strong>smooth experience for a wide range of hardware</strong>, ensuring high-end visuals are accessible and optimized for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090720/extras/1f7e00f99e3fd32c76b5c2cd2e76209f.poster.avif?t=1785379195\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090720/extras/1f7e00f99e3fd32c76b5c2cd2e76209f.webm?t=1785379195\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4090720/extras/1f7e00f99e3fd32c76b5c2cd2e76209f.mp4?t=1785379195\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit version 1909 revision .1350 or higher, or versions 2004 and 20H2 revision .789 or higher.<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7400 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 mobile<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX-compatible<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> No VR Support</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit version 1909 revision .1350 or higher, or versions 2004 and 20H2 revision .789 or higher.<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10400 / Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 3060 / AMD RX 6600 XT<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX-compatible<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> No VR Support</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie"],"developers":["Surin"],"publishers":["Devotion Interactıve"],"release_date":"Jul 29, 2026"}